          "className": "w-[30px] h-[35px]"
        }
      ],
      "additionalDetailsItems": [
        {
          "id": "size-fit",
          "title": "size & fit",
          "contentType": "text",
          "content": "Please refer to our size guide to see what size is right for you! Keep in mind, sizes between brands are likely to vary, so please use the measurements as a guide only.",
          "linkLabel": "view size guide",
          "linkURI": {
            "default": "https://www.roddandgunn.com/au",
            "us": "https://www.roddandgunn.com/us/sizeguide_full.html",
            "au": "https://www.roddandgunn.com/au/sizeguide_full.html"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "designer-notes",
          "title": "Designer Notes",
          "contentType": "list",
          "apidata": true,
          "listItems": [
            "100% Australian Good Earth Cotton: modern regenerative farming techniques bring us climate positive cotton, fully verified with the power of FibreTrace®",
            "Jersey knit body features a textured melange effect.",
            "Embroidered with our pointer emblem on the chest",
            "Premium zip by Japanese company YKK, with a genuine leather puller de-bossed with our logo",
            "Ribbed funnel neck, cuffs and waist",
            "Panels are machine knitted separately and then engineered together, providing a superior fit",
            "Care instructions: Hand wash",
            "Model is wearing size ME and measures: Chest 106cms/41.5\", Height 187.5cms/6'1\"",
            "Made in Cambodia",
            "Stylecode - EP0796"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pick-in-store",
          "title": "CLICK & COLLECT",
          "contentType": "list",
          "apidata": false,
